                                "text": [
                                  "The Unbought Line",
                                  "The surveyor\nbilled for\nmeasuring walls,\nnot for reaching\nSlush's",
                                  "preferred result.\nWhen asked to move\na boundary on\npaper, she",
                                  "offered to measure\nit again. Her\nsecond measurement\nagreed with the",
